# Architecture

- Use Vue 3 Composition API with `<script setup lang="ts">`.
- Put reusable UI in `src/components/` and feature code in `src/features/<name>/`.
- Keep views thin; composables own reusable reactive behavior.
- Keep HTTP and persistence behind typed modules, not inside templates.
- Pass data with typed props and emit explicit events.
- Keep tests beside the components or composables they cover.
